  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project development objectives are: (a) to enhance capacity and awareness at key national agencies and at local levelscomma to respond to climate variability and change; and (b) to better equip local communities to cope with climate change through the conservation and use of agro-biodiversity.</narrative>
